      'The U-46 race is the most crowded, with six candidates competing for three seats. The district\'s handling of a 2024 financial audit finding — which identified $2.3 million in improperly documented expenditures — has dominated candidate forums.',
      'Early voting begins April 30. Election Day is May 12.',
