      'BATAVIA — Junior midfielder Ava Kowalski scored twice in a four-minute span early in the second half Saturday evening, lifting the Batavia Bulldogs to a 2-0 victory over crosstown rival Geneva in the IHSA Class 3A sectional championship at Bulldog Stadium.',
