      'Kowalski\'s first goal came in the 47th minute off a corner kick served in by senior captain Reese Halverson. Four minutes later, Kowalski collected a through ball from sophomore Jenna Olstad and slotted it past Geneva goalkeeper Claire Dunham to double the lead. It was Kowalski\'s 18th and 19th goals of the season.',
